{{see|pita}}
==English==

===Pronunciation===
Usually pronounced as the noun ''[[pita]]'' with more emphasis on second sylable (peh-TAH instead of pee-tah).

===Noun===
'''PITA'''

# {{cattag|acronym}} PITA is an initialism or acronym for "pain in the ass". It is often used informally for a person the speaker finds troublesome, but can also refer to a nagging problem, or any task that is more awkward and complicated than it should be.